       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.             TWOTRACK.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.        IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.        IBM-AS400.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT WO-TRACK-FILE
                  ASSIGN       TO DATABASE-MCFLMM2601
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS MODE  IS RANDOM
                  RECORD KEY   IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                               WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS  IS FILE-STATUS.

       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  WO-TRACK-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS       ARE STANDARD
           DATA RECORD         IS WOTRK.
       01  WOTRK.
           COPY DD-MCRPMM2600  OF MCFLMM2601.

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       77  FILE-STATUS         PIC XX.

       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01  WO-TRACK-DATA.
           COPY DWOTRACK       OF COPYLIB.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION      USING WO-TRACK-DATA.
       START-PROCESSING.
           OPEN I-O            WO-TRACK-FILE.
           WRITE WOTRK         FROM WO-TRACK-DATA
               INVALID KEY     MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = ZEROS
             DISPLAY "FAILED TO WRITE TRACKING RECORD: " FILE-STATUS.
           CLOSE               WO-TRACK-FILE.
           GOBACK.

